{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手王灝兒（JW）自從在《叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎禮》記者會，公開承認已秘嫁有米老公王至尊（Jim Wong）後，不再對人妻身份話題左閃右避，相反表現超大方，兩公婆恩愛現身衛蘭演唱會外，JW更一早預告夫妻檔上陣，擔任兩人的首個「愛情結晶品」新歌《</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.948100+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:01:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820262+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820262+00:00","content_hash":"39f37f2124ab08e104a2a41192f8fe20b0ff24f57d4c2b19b938c6ebff93328e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}